    ["<Assistant_Title1>【仲夏夜】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>商城直售时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>商城购买后获得仲夏夜套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Midsummer Night】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the Midsummer Night outfit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【歌剧魅影-搭配规则】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>搭配阶段：</>本场主题公布后，满足资格的俱乐部成员可以进入搭配界面，根据主题关卡进行时装搭配。保存搭配后会计算搭配评分，并进入俱乐部本场评分排名。动作搭配主要影响表演效果，不影响评分。\n<Assistant_Title2>风格：</>每件外观拥有5组对立风格中的属性，如优雅/嬉皮、光明/黑暗、简约/奢华、纯真/冷酷、春夏/秋冬。每场会指定主风格和次风格，主风格权重更高。\n<Assistant_Title2>分数来源：</>单件服饰风格分会根据和每场主题的匹配度计算出基本分数，还会根据不同的染色等级受到染色加成；最终总分还会受到风尚鉴赏收集度的全局加成影响。\n<Assistant_Title2>参赛选手：</>进入调整阶段后，搭配会被锁定，俱乐部本场搭配评分前<Assistant_Red>5</>的成员自动成为参赛选手。\n<Assistant_Title2>调整顺序：</>有权限的管理者可以调整5名参赛选手的出场顺序；比赛前一段时间会禁止继续调整。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Phantom of the Opera - Coordination Rules】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Coordination Phase: </>After the theme for the round is announced, eligible club members can enter the coordination interface to perform fashion coordination based on the theme level. After saving the coordination, the coordination score will be calculated, and you will enter the club's score ranking for this round. Action coordination mainly affects performance effects and does not affect the score. \n<Assistant_Title2>Style: </>Each appearance has attributes from 5 opposing style groups, such as Elegant/Hippie, Light/Dark, Minimalist/Luxurious, Innocent/Cold, Spring-Summer/Autumn-Winter. Each round will specify a main style and a secondary style, with the main style having a higher weight. \n<Assistant_Title2>Score Source: </>The style score of a single piece of clothing will be calculated based on the matching degree with each round's theme, and will also receive dyeing bonuses based on different dyeing levels; the final total score will also be affected by the global bonus of Fashion Appreciation collection. \n<Assistant_Title2>Contestants: </>After entering the adjustment phase, the coordination will be locked, and the top <Assistant_Red>5</> members in the club's coordination score for this round will automatically become contestants. \n<Assistant_Title2>Adjusting Order: </>Authorized managers can adjust the appearance order of the 5 contestants; adjusting will be prohibited for a period of time before the match.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>廷根舞王</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>跑团-秩序世界\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>在廷根任意跳舞点累计跳舞超过240小时"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Tingen Dance King</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category:</>TRPG-Order World\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition:</>Accumulate over 240 hours of dancing at any Dance Point in Tingen",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>猎人的收获</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>以战养战-竞逐\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>获得200点终末猎杀段位胜点"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Hunter's Harvest</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>War-Driven - Competition\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Obtain 200 Victory Points in Final Hunt rank",
    ["<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">兔子</>之神<Delete id=\"#158\">比必币</>庇佑，信徒愿意一生吃<Delete id=\"#158\">书数</>蔬菜，只希<Delete id=\"#158\">忘</>望您宽恕我的罪过。\n我会用白色<Delete id=\"#158\">拉</>蜡烛，按照兔子的形状<Delete id=\"#158\">拜</>摆放祭坛，绝不忘记圆圈中心的眼睛和<Delete id=\"#158\">比</>鼻子！"] = "May the God of <Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">Rabbits</><Delete id=\"#158\">Bibi Coins</> bless me. This believer vows to eat <Delete id=\"#158\">books</> vegetables for life and only <Delete id=\"#158\">forgets</> hopes that You will forgive my sins.\nI will use white <Delete id=\"#158\">pull</> candles and <Delete id=\"#158\">worship</> arrange the altar in the shape of a rabbit, never forgetting the eyes and <Delete id=\"#158\">compare</> nose in the center of the circle!",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>蓝白蕾丝・俏皮兔耳・童话礼服\n即便是误入的来客，也请遵从着装的礼仪。换上蓝白菱格的俏皮礼服，加入怪诞奇妙的茶会。"] = "<Highlight>Craftsmanship: </>Blue-White Lace, Playful Rabbit Ears, & Fairytale Gown\nEven if you are an accidental guest, please follow the etiquette of dress. Put on the playful blue-and-white diamond-patterned gown and join the whimsical tea party.",
    ["<M_Default>亲爱的非凡者：</>\n<M_Default>恭喜您在主宰争锋玩法中跻身全国排名前100，特赠荣誉头衔，可前往</><HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250011\">【菜单-角色-头衔界面】</><M_Default>使用。</>"] = "<M_Default> Dear Beyonder: </>\n<M_Default> Congratulations on ranking in the top 100 nationwide in the Dominator's Clash. You have been awarded an honorary title. You can go to </><HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1250011\"> [Menu - Character - Title Interface] </><M_Default> to use it. </>",
    ["<M_Orange> [%s]</>已向你的俱乐部发起宣战，静候回应。 请在<M_Orange>1小时内</>前往<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302473\">【俱乐部宣战】</>作出裁决——逾期未应，将视为自动认输，<M_Orange>并扣除相应俱乐部资金</>。"] = "<M_Orange> [%s]</> has declared war on your club. Awaiting response. Please go to <M_Orange>within 1 hour</> to <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"jump=1302473\">【Club War Declaration】</> to make a ruling—failure to respond will be considered an automatic forfeit, <M_Orange>and the corresponding club funds will be deducted</>.",
    ["<Red>引雷</>：持有者对目标触发闪电时，有50%概率对自己也施加闪电造成伤害，闪电有50%几率触发3秒的滞涩效果。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机一条非凡物质词条属性失效。"] = "<Red>Lightning Attraction</>: When the holder triggers lightning on a target, there is a 50% probability that it will also deal lightning damage to themselves, and the lightning has a 50% chance to trigger a 3-second Stagnation effect. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Beyonder material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["<Title>势力预分配</>\n<Highlight>9月12日21:30—9月13日12:00</>，系统将统一进行一次势力预分配。\n\n<Title>势力调整</>\n<Highlight>9月13日12:00—9月13日18:00</>，各赛区筛选第1名俱乐部将被锁定，无法调整势力；其余俱乐部的会长可手动调整己方势力。每个势力最多容纳<Highlight>4个俱乐部</>。截止18:00，仍未选择势力的俱乐部将由系统随机分配。\n\n<Title>势力对战</>\n9月13日18:00后，所有俱乐部势力将锁定。<Highlight>9月17日维护后</>将开启为期一个月的势力对战；对战期间势力不会变动，各俱乐部将代表所属势力角逐战略服荣耀。"] = "<Title>Faction Pre-assignment</>\n<Highlight>September 12, 21:30 – September 13, 12:00</>, the system will perform a unified faction pre-assignment.\n\n<Title>Faction Adjustment</>\n<Highlight>September 13, 12:00 – September 13, 18:00</>, the top-ranked Club in each division will be locked and cannot change factions; leaders of other Clubs can manually adjust their faction. Each faction can hold a maximum of <Highlight>4 Clubs</>. By 18:00, Clubs that have not selected a faction will be randomly assigned by the system.\n\n<Title>Faction War</>\nAfter 18:00 on September 13, all Club factions will be locked.<Highlight>After the maintenance on September 17,</> a month-long Faction War will begin; factions will not change during the war, and each Club will represent its faction to compete for the glory of the Strategic Server.",
