    ["愚者教会信徒创设的福利制度。感谢各界人士对愚者教会的支持。\n聆听《愚者圣典》，赞美愚者！愿我主的恩典在您身边日夜相伴，成为您前行路上永不熄灭的灯火！\n购买立即获得<Highlight>300</>金镑以及<Highlight>2个</>活力方糖，并获得持续<Highlight>30</>天的福音券运势解读，以及解锁如下特权：\n<Highlight>※人脉快速互动次数增加：</>每日可额外获得<Highlight>5次快速互动次数</>，消耗道具可以直接获得与对应人脉的好感度。\n<Highlight>※玩法货币获取效率提升：</>获得<Highlight>冒险勋章</>、<Highlight>凯旋徽章</>以及<Highlight>同行纹章</>时，效率提升<Highlight>20%</>。<Highlight>终末猎杀</>提交猩红遗物时，获取<Highlight>猎杀进度</>的效率额外提升20%。\n<Highlight>※自定义传送信标：</>可在公共场景地图中记录<Highlight>福音尖碑坐标</>，记录完成后可随时传送到对应的<Highlight>福音尖碑</>处。\n<Highlight>※活力上限增加：</>活力累计上限增加<Highlight>1000</>点。\n此外，每日登录可获得<Highlight>100</>绑定金镑以及<Highlight>愚者馈赠</>，累积登录还可额外获得更多<Highlight>活力方糖</>。\n愚者福音最多可持续<Highlight>180</>天，达上限后再次获得愚者福音将会转化为等额金镑。"] = "A welfare system established by believers of The Fool Church. Thank you for your support. \n Listen to the \"Fool's Scripture\" and praise The Fool! May the grace of our Lord accompany you day and night, becoming the eternal light on your path forward! \n Purchase to immediately receive <Highlight> 300 </> Gold Pounds and <Highlight> 2 </> Vitality Sugar Cubes. You will also receive a Gospel Coupon fortune reading for <Highlight> 30 </> days, and unlock the following privileges: \n <Highlight> ※ Increased Quick Interaction limit: </> Receive <Highlight> 5 additional </> Quick Interaction attempts daily; consume items to directly gain favorability with corresponding contacts. \n <Highlight> ※ Increased gameplay currency efficiency: </> Efficiency for obtaining <Highlight> Adventure Medals </>, <Highlight> Triumph Badges </>, and <Highlight> Companion Emblems </> is increased by <Highlight> 20% </>. <Highlight> End-of-Days Hunt </> submission of Scarlet Relics grants 20% more <Highlight> Hunting Progress </>. \n <Highlight> ※ Custom Teleport Beacon: </> Record <Highlight> Gospel Stele </> coordinates in public maps; once recorded, you can teleport to the corresponding <Highlight> Gospel Stele </> at any time. \n <Highlight> ※ Increased Vitality cap: </> Cumulative Vitality cap increased by <Highlight> 1000 </> points. \n Additionally, receive <Highlight> 100 </> Bound Gold Pounds and <Highlight> The Fool's Gift </> upon daily login. Cumulative logins grant even more <Highlight> Vitality Sugar Cubes </>. \n The Fool's Gospel can last up to <Highlight> 180 </> days; once the limit is reached, subsequent Fool's Gospel rewards will be converted into an equivalent amount of Gold Pounds.",
