    ["我最喜欢热闹！空气里炖汤香极了，叫卖声也好听。莴苣叶子滴着水，马铃薯圆滚滚的，多可爱！"] = "I love the hustle and bustle! The smell of stew in the air is wonderful, and the hawking sounds are pleasant too. The lettuce leaves are dripping with water, and the potatoes are so round and cute!",
